Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6, zlib1g, libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libepoxy0, libegl1, libgles2, libfontconfig1, libsecret-1-0, libdbus-1-3
Recommends: network-manager | iw, gnome-keyring | kwallet6 | keepassxc
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://well-fed.dev
Description: App for Wellfed pet feeders
 Wellfed is open firmware for a pet feeder, and this is its app. It talks
 to each feeder directly on your home network, with no cloud and no
 account: feeds, meal plans, history, settings and alerts while it is open.
